From 42ae4cb1899a44936fbb4d3d4a32276f37ce37fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nova <361320585+q2-nova@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 17:43:07 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] MIPS: Q2: consume chosen bootargs for FDT kexec entry

The independent Buildroot integration exposed that UHI a0=-2 entry
carries command-line flags in the FDT. Select DTB command-line sourcing;
cold boot without chosen bootargs still falls back to bootloader
arguments.
---
 arch/mips/configs/shanling_q2_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/mips/configs/shanling_q2_defconfig b/arch/mips/configs/shanling_q2_defconfig
index 93facf7ce..5b8503d15 100644
--- a/arch/mips/configs/shanling_q2_defconfig
+++ b/arch/mips/configs/shanling_q2_defconfig
@@ -111,3 +111,4 @@ CONFIG_PHY_INGENIC_X2000_USB=y
 CONFIG_CONFIGFS_FS=y
 CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS=y
 CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_RNDIS=y
+CONFIG_MIPS_CMDLINE_FROM_DTB=y
